=\"bullet\"></span>书店停留时长</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"card-note\">门票价格、交通班次与真实营业时间不在本材料范围内，出行前自行核实。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"foot\">\n    <div class=\"foot-left\">\n      <div class=\"foot-label\">说 明</div>\n      <p><strong>青岚市及文中景点均为虚构，仅供测评参考。</strong>本材料不提供真实票价、交通班次与营业时间，也不含日期与预算信息。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot-right\">\n      <div class=\"thanks\">感谢阅读</div>\n      <div class=\"thanks-rule\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <div class=\"page-no\">6 / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"The style: cream paper background, ink green, gold accent, serif display font (Bodoni Moda → fallback Georgia/serif), body Archivo → fallback Helvetica/Arial. No external fonts allowed (禁止引用外部资源/外部字体). So use local font stacks: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif for display; 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif for body.\n\nLayout: 1920×1080, margins 96px, top rule, page number bottom-right \"6 / 6\", rail label vertical, gridlines, register circle top-right, dot fields.\n\nContent: 总结与致谢 page. Points:\n- 两天节奏：慢行、拍照、保留机动时间\n- 已完成：行程框架与步行上限设定\n- 未确定：日期、集合点、停留时长待补充\n- 青岚市及景点均为虚构，仅供测评参考\n- 感谢阅读\n\nDesign: title 总结与致谢 top-left, subtitle. Two cards: 已完成 (accent primary green) and 未确定 (gold/tertiary). Plus a footer strip with 虚构声明 and 感谢阅读.\n\nLet me write clean HTML.\n\nStructure:\n- .bg-field, dot fields, gridlines, top-rule, left-rule, register, edge prism, rail label, top-meta \"青岚市周末慢游 · 总结\", page-no \"6 / 6\" bottom right.\n\nTitle area: small eyebrow \"06 · 总结\", h1 \"总结与致谢\" (104px serif), subtitle line: 两天节奏：慢行、拍照、保留机动时间.\n\nTwo columns cards:\nCard A: 已完成 (label with green dot) — items:\n- 行程框架与步行上限设定\n- 首日 ≤ 4.6 公里 · 次日 ≤ 3.2 公里 (from doc: 首日步行上限4.6公里，次日步行上限3.2公里) — allowed.\n- 5人同行节奏统一 (from doc umbrella? page 2 bullet says 同行5人，按此人数统一节奏 — but that's outline, still derived from doc: 同行人数5人). Keep to doc facts: \"2天5人同行\" from doc. OK.\n\nCard B: 未确定 (待补充):\n- 日期\n- 集合点\n- 书店停留时长\n- 门票价格与开放时间（不在本材料范围，需自行核实）\n\nHmm, careful: 